# shadow-mask-org0.env with the shadow mask family on (CS_ORG_SHADOW_MASK=1, docs/development/p5/shadow-mask.md): each shadow-casting
# light's pass into kSHADOW_MASK, the world's and the menu scenes', drawn at the EngineDraws anchor. Expect "[DCLF] shadow mask: on",
# "the cs.shadow-mask.world client registered", "every world shadow mask draw can be drawn by the graph", "the first
# cs.shadow-mask.world run drawn by the graph" (and the same for menu in the inventory), no "back to the engine's draws", and shots
# equal to org0's: the sun's shadows in Whiterun, the hall's lights' shadows in Dragonsreach, the item's shadow in the inventory. The
# census lines lose "RT kSHADOW_MASK DS none" (AE 107141 and 52728).
CS_ORG_SHADOW_MASK=1
CS_ORG_TRIPWIRE_GUEST=1
CS_ORG_RESIDUE_CENSUS=1
CS_ORG_RESIDUE_CENSUS_FRAMES=300
DXVK_DEBUG=hang
VK_LOADER_LAYERS_DISABLE=*nsight*
CS_DCLF_TEST_COMMANDS=600:set timescale to 0;601:set gamehour to 13;700:coc Whiterun;1300:set timescale to 20;1310:fw 81a;1400:set timescale to 0;1401:set gamehour to 13;1500:dclf:shot=whiterun;1600:coc WhiterunDragonsreach;2400:dclf:shot=dragonsreach;2500:dclf:menu=InventoryMenu=show;2900:dclf:shot=inventory;2910:dclf:menu=InventoryMenu=hide;3000:dclf:menu=MagicMenu=show;3400:dclf:shot=magic;3410:dclf:menu=MagicMenu=hide
CS_DCLF_TEST_EXIT=3500
